{"1649414316490194944":{"a":"<p>RT @CherokeeNation: 🧵:</p>\n<p>We love sharing highlights from our “We Are Cherokee: #CherokeeFreedmen and the Right to Citizenship” exhibit.</p>\n<p>So…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1649414316490194944\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1649414316490194944</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1649414316490194944</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1649414316490194944\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-04-21T14:06:32Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>retweet</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1649422930781020167":{"a":"<p>@NotABombBunkE @makerfairemiami @MakerFaireConey @nyit Congrats!!!</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/NotABombBunkE/status/1649421868602892293\">https://x.com/NotABombBunkE/status/1649421868602892293</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1649422930781020167</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1649422930781020167\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-04-21T14:40:46Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1649430786808901637":{"a":"<p>I believe nothing. I know that beyond learning language, remembering the confusion, it takes a couple decades to understand the context and symbology used in these books. That&#x27;s when you are trying. Someone spoonfed a sentence or three every week or so may never make sense of it. <a href=\"https://x.com/RossKneeDeep/status/1649402719965270016\">Tweet by @RossKneeDeep</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/RossKneeDeep/status/1649402719965270016\">https://x.com/RossKneeDeep/status/1649402719965270016</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1649430786808901637</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/statu